{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "try-activate",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "[GAS 原生]\n文件：GameplayAbilities/AbilitySystemComponent\n函数：TryActivateAbility\n作用：收到输入或事件后请求激活 Ability",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 180
    },
    {
      "id": "can-activate",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "[Lyra 自定义 + GAS]\n文件：Source/LyraGame/AbilitySystem/Abilities/LyraGameplayAbility.cpp\n函数：CanActivateAbility\n作用：执行 GAS 基础条件和 Lyra 激活组检查",
      "x": 450,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 190
    },
    {
      "id": "group-check",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "[Lyra 自定义]\n文件：Source/LyraGame/AbilitySystem/LyraAbilitySystemComponent.cpp\n函数：IsActivationGroupBlocked\n作用：判断 Independent/Replaceable/Blocking 是否允许激活",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 190
    },
    {
      "id": "notify-activated",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "[GAS 回调 + Lyra 覆盖]\n文件：Source/LyraGame/AbilitySystem/LyraAbilitySystemComponent.cpp\n函数：NotifyAbilityActivated\n作用：激活成功后维护 Lyra 激活组计数",
