      "text": "[Lyra 自定义]\n文件：Source/LyraGame/AbilitySystem/LyraAbilitySystemComponent.cpp\n函数：AddAbilityToActivationGroup\n作用：加入组，并让新的 Exclusive Ability 处理替换规则",
      "x": 1930,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190
    },
    {
